    {
      "Original": " MGP to challenge ",
      "Context": "PlayNpc.MoveNext",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": " 金碟币才能挑战 ",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " You need ",
      "Context": "PlayNpc.MoveNext",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": " 需要 ",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " is nearby!",
      "Context": "FireAlerts",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": " 位于附近！",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": ", so the run stops.",
      "Context": "PlayNpc.MoveNext",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": "，本次已停止。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "A glass of water and a quick stretch can reset a long session.",
      "Context": "About..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "喝杯水，稍微伸个懒腰，从长时间的对局中歇一歇。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "A little reminder",
      "Context": "About..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "温馨提示",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "About",
      "Context": "Shell..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "关于",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Always play one of your saved decks.",
      "Context": "Deck..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "始终使用已保存的卡组之一。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Been at it a while? Roll your shoulders and take one slow breath.",
      "Context": "About..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "已经玩了一阵子？转转肩膀，慢慢呼吸一次。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Blink a few times and let your eyes rest for a moment.",
      "Context": "About..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "眨几下眼睛，让眼睛休息片刻。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Browse the source code and every release.",
      "Context": "About..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CalcTextSize",
      "Translated": "浏览源代码和各个版本。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Build the strongest deck against each NPC from your collection.",
      "Context": "Deck..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "根据收藏的卡牌，为每位 NPC 组建胜算最高的卡组。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Changelog",
      "Context": "Shell..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "更新记录",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
