      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Eyes feel tired? Look at something far away for twenty seconds.",
      "Context": "About..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "眼睛累了吗？向远处看二十秒。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
